{
  "name": "New Google Jobs postings to Google Sheets every morning",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New Google Jobs postings to Google Sheets every morning\n\nEvery morning, pull the jobs posted today on Google Jobs (LinkedIn, Indeed, Glassdoor, company career sites) for your job titles and cities and append them to a Google Sheet: title, company, location, salary min/max, posted date and the apply link.\n\n### Setup (3 minutes)\n1. **Apify token** - create a free account at apify.com and copy your API token (Settings > API & Integrations).\n   In the **Get Google Jobs** node, create a *Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`.\n2. **Google Sheets** node - connect your Google account and paste the URL of an empty sheet. Columns are created from the data automatically.\n3. Edit the JSON body of **Get Google Jobs** with your own inputs, then activate the workflow.\n\n**Cost:** pay per job posting; see the Actor page. `maxTotalChargeUsd` in the body is a hard cap per run.\nActor: https://apify.com/om_kh/google-jobs-scraper",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460
      },
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -540,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "5cc9d0cb-ea19-4054-9f28-dd78680527f5"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Every morning",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
